L001580	imperfection introduced into the system is $O(\Delta P)$ in size,
L001581	the imperfection does not affect the linear operator $\mathcal{L}$.
L001582	Hence, the amplitudes and natural frequencies of the pre-snap-through
L001583	oscillations are not influenced by the imperfection.}
